From: Leonid <leonidy.1985@yandex.ru>
Date: Wed, 25 Nov 2026 12:38:48 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] power: supply: add the MT6358 fuel gauge

Project series 0072 and 0073. Reads BATADC through the MT6358 AUXADC and
the FGADC current through the PMIC regmap, then converts the IR-compensated
OCV to capacity with the battery profile from the board DT. Registers the
mt6358-gauge MFD cell; mt6370-charger keeps its OCV fallback.
---
